      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you help me write a memo for our company leadership? We need a formal policy on \"Political Expression in the Workplace.\" The goal is to maintain a cohesive, inclusive environment while still acknowledging employees' rights to individual expression. Please make sure it's professional and covers all the key considerations for a large tech firm.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft for your policy introduction, which you can adapt for the full document.\n\n\"This policy, 'Political Expression in the Workplace,' is established to support a professional and inclusive environment for all of our dedicated team members. We strongly respect the right of our employees to hold and believe in a wide range of political views, but this right must be balanced with the need to maintain a focused, bias-free, and respectful workplace for everyone. This guidance will clearly define appropriate and inappropriate political discourse to ensure we support strong opinions without compromising our commitment to a cohesive and high-performing culture.\"",
